# Local builds & test artifacts
/relay
/agent
/dist/
*.log
*.test
*.out
.env
.env.*
coverage.txt

# Signing key material. The minisign keypair that authenticates daemon
# manifests must never be committed: the public half is compiled into every
# installer, so the private half is root on the whole fleet. It lives in
# GitHub Actions secrets (MINISIGN_SECRET_KEY) and nowhere in a working tree.
*.key
!*.pub.key
hasfy-updater.*
minisign.key
*.minisig
